# Files that must never reach a deployment.
#
# Pulse builds with @sveltejs/adapter-static, so `pnpm build` has to run on the
# host: everything below is either a local cache, a regenerated output or a
# development-only artifact. Keeping them out of the upload is worth ~17 MB,
# almost all of it screenshots from the verification pass.

# Regenerated by the build
.svelte-kit
build
node_modules

# Local verification artifacts (screenshots, Lighthouse reports, report.json)
.verify

# Verification tooling: needed to review the project, not to serve it
tools

# Notes written by the agent that built this, not part of the site
PROGRESS.md

# Token local que crea el propio CLI de Vercel al enlazar el proyecto
.env*.local
.vercel
